# Copy to `.env.production` (or set in your host's build env) and fill in.
# Math solver backend (Pix2Text + SymPy) — see ../math-server for the deploy.
#
# MUST be https:// in production: the PWA is served from https://onepen-notes.web.app,
# and a browser blocks an http:// backend from an https:// page as mixed content.
# Hugging Face Space URLs look like https://<user>-<space>.hf.space/predict.
#
# Leave unset for local dev — it falls back to the page's own host on :8000
# (so a tablet on the LAN auto-targets your machine), then 127.0.0.1:8000.
VITE_MATH_API_URL=
